1
00:00:03,360 --> 00:00:07,130
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,130 --> 00:00:11,080
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,560 --> 00:00:15,810
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,810 --> 00:00:20,970
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,240 --> 00:00:24,960
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,360 --> 00:00:28,210
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,210 --> 00:00:33,480
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,680 --> 00:00:37,440
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,800 --> 00:00:40,440
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,840 --> 00:00:44,810
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,810 --> 00:00:47,800
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:47,960 --> 00:00:50,650
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,670 --> 00:00:54,000
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,240 --> 00:00:57,170
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,170 --> 00:01:00,250
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,410 --> 00:01:03,130
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,130 --> 00:01:06,570
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,650 --> 00:01:19,010
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,170 --> 00:01:22,090
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,250 --> 00:01:25,210
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,330 --> 00:01:28,170
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,170 --> 00:01:32,810
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,560 --> 00:01:43,440
Renegade Immortal\NSubtitles by Bonobosubs\Nhttps://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:01:49,780 --> 00:01:52,870
Depths of the Tide Abyss

25
00:01:58,670 --> 00:02:00,950
Si She\NDa Lou Sword Sect disciple\NLate stage Soul Transformation

26
00:02:01,270 --> 00:02:04,190
Xu Gou\NDa Lou Sword Sect disciple\NLate stage Soul Transformation

27
00:02:06,190 --> 00:02:09,110
You Ji\NDa Lou Sword Sect disciple\NLate stage Soul Transformation

28
00:02:15,910 --> 00:02:16,340
Senior Brother !

29
00:02:16,470 --> 00:02:16,940
Senior Brother !

30
00:02:18,190 --> 00:02:18,820
Senior Brother...

31
00:02:21,910 --> 00:02:22,990
Senior Greed,

32
00:02:21,750 --> 00:02:24,150
Chen Long\NDa Lou Sword Sect disciple\NEarly stage Ascendant

33
00:02:23,150 --> 00:02:24,470
it's impossible to drive away

34
00:02:24,670 --> 00:02:27,220
these demonic beasts with my limited strength.

35
00:02:28,190 --> 00:02:29,540
Junior beg you to do something

36
00:02:30,310 --> 00:02:31,910
to get us out of this place !

37
00:02:32,190 --> 00:02:34,390
Greed\NPeak Late stage Ascendant\N(Originally Illusory Yin)

38
00:02:37,750 --> 00:02:38,900
Junior Brother Shen Hou

39
00:02:39,470 --> 00:02:41,460
was killed by those beasts the day before yesterday.

40
00:02:42,430 --> 00:02:44,140
Since Senior remains so unmoved...

41
00:02:45,390 --> 00:02:46,670
Is it possible that...

42
00:02:47,110 --> 00:02:49,060
you're unafraid of betraying Master's trust !?

43
00:02:57,830 --> 00:02:59,220
Little brats...

44
00:02:59,990 --> 00:03:02,540
For the sake of your Master,

45
00:03:03,030 --> 00:03:05,140
this old man will forgive your disrespect.

46
00:03:05,870 --> 00:03:07,780
But if you do it again...

47
00:03:10,670 --> 00:03:12,100
The Tide Abyss

48
00:03:12,630 --> 00:03:16,820
doesn't only pull in artifacts from the starry sky.

49
00:03:17,710 --> 00:03:19,710
All kinds of ferocious demonic beasts

50
00:03:19,710 --> 00:03:21,580
were also pulled in here.

51
00:03:22,310 --> 00:03:23,820
At the bottom of this abyss,

52
00:03:24,190 --> 00:03:27,070
the beasts that were able to survive that environment

53
00:03:27,110 --> 00:03:29,020
are entities even I am unwilling to provoke.

54
00:03:28,790 --> 00:03:30,350
Wu Ma\NDa Lou Sword Sect disciple\NPeak Late stage Soul Transformation

55
00:03:30,230 --> 00:03:32,860
If you guys dare to rush in blindly,

56
00:03:33,270 --> 00:03:35,340
it's a direct path to your deaths.

57
00:03:43,030 --> 00:03:44,270
Forgive us, Senior.

58
00:03:44,590 --> 00:03:46,540
But we have been trapped here by these beasts

59
00:03:47,150 --> 00:03:48,430
for 100 years already.

60
00:03:50,270 --> 00:03:51,540
Are you in a rush ?

61
00:03:52,190 --> 00:03:53,580
In another 100 years,

62
00:03:53,790 --> 00:03:56,020
Ling Tianhou will personally come to save us.

63
00:03:57,190 --> 00:03:58,300
This journey is secret

64
00:03:58,870 --> 00:04:01,780
so no one in the Demon Spirit Land knows our whereabouts.

65
00:04:02,270 --> 00:04:05,780
The safest place to wait is right here.

66
00:04:10,510 --> 00:04:11,660
6 entrances

67
00:04:12,590 --> 00:04:14,380
but only a single exit.

68
00:04:13,470 --> 00:04:16,590
Tide Abyss Exit\NFire Demon Country

69
00:04:15,790 --> 00:04:16,820
Senior Zhou Yi

70
00:04:17,950 --> 00:04:19,980
is beneath this Tide Abyss.

71
00:04:24,190 --> 00:04:25,540
This restriction isn't for killing

72
00:04:26,270 --> 00:04:27,710
but for gathering information.

73
00:04:28,790 --> 00:04:30,640
Greed has a profound cultivation,

74
00:04:30,790 --> 00:04:31,580
I must stay on guard.

75
00:04:41,350 --> 00:04:43,990
Tide Abyss Entrance\NWater Demon Country

76
00:04:45,590 --> 00:04:46,310
Brother Murong,

77
00:04:46,310 --> 00:04:47,350
Junior Sisters,

78
00:04:47,550 --> 00:04:49,750
Du Jian\NHeavenly Fate Sect Red Division disciple\NPeak Late stage Soul Transformation

79
00:04:47,670 --> 00:04:48,790
this is the place.

80
00:04:49,670 --> 00:04:51,710
I've studied the Tide Abyss for decades

81
00:04:51,710 --> 00:04:53,190
to finally find this entrance.

82
00:04:53,710 --> 00:04:54,740
If we enter together,

83
00:04:55,190 --> 00:04:56,710
we're sure to have a great harvest.

84
00:04:57,190 --> 00:04:59,510
Murong Zhuo\NPlanet Tian Yun's Ink Sect disciple\NEarly stage Ascendant

85
00:04:57,910 --> 00:04:58,790
The person arriving

86
00:04:58,990 --> 00:04:59,790
is very strong.

87
00:05:08,630 --> 00:05:09,950
Junior Brother Wang, please wait !

88
00:05:15,830 --> 00:05:16,830
Junior Brother Wang,

89
00:05:16,950 --> 00:05:18,020
I am Du Jian of the Red Division.

90
00:05:19,590 --> 00:05:21,780
This is Murong Zhuo from the Ink Sect.

91
00:05:23,510 --> 00:05:25,540
These two are from the Floating Cloud Sect.

92
00:05:26,630 --> 00:05:27,300
Senior Brother Wang,

93
00:05:26,910 --> 00:05:29,630
Zhao Yixuan\NFloating Cloud Sect disciple\NLate stage Soul Transformation

94
00:05:27,670 --> 00:05:28,740
I am Zhao Yixuan.

95
00:05:29,630 --> 00:05:31,820
This is my Junior Sister, Xu Fei.

96
00:05:31,070 --> 00:05:33,390
Xu Fei\NFloating Cloud Sect disciple\NLate stage Soul Transformation

97
00:05:34,030 --> 00:05:34,980
Xu Fei ?

98
00:05:35,290 --> 00:05:38,590
Note: Xu Fei was a disciple of the Heng Yue Sect we only saw in episode 4.

99
00:05:41,510 --> 00:05:42,630
Junior Brother Wang,

100
00:05:42,630 --> 00:05:44,710
is it possible that you have a history with Junior Sister Xu ?

101
00:05:44,790 --> 00:05:45,750
I don't know her.

102
00:05:46,430 --> 00:05:48,270
It's just that Junior Sister Xu

103
00:05:48,550 --> 00:05:50,170
has the same name

104
00:05:50,190 --> 00:05:51,820
as someone I knew in my youth.

105
00:05:53,110 --> 00:05:56,340
So Junior Brother Wang is also here for the Tide Abyss.

106
00:05:57,110 --> 00:05:58,590
Why don't we travel together

107
00:05:58,630 --> 00:06:00,190
to face the dangers together ?

108
00:06:00,350 --> 00:06:01,350
What do you think ?

109
00:06:01,990 --> 00:06:04,900
He's merely native from a wasted cultivation planet.

110
00:06:05,670 --> 00:06:06,420
But back then,

111
00:06:06,750 --> 00:06:09,070
he almost became one of the Seven Sons of Tian Yun.

112
00:06:09,190 --> 00:06:10,460
If we let him grow,

113
00:06:10,870 --> 00:06:12,630
I'm afraid that we, his Senior Brothers,

114
00:06:12,750 --> 00:06:14,740
will never have a chance to rise again.

115
00:06:18,110 --> 00:06:20,420
This person was able to detect me in advance.

116
00:06:21,790 --> 00:06:22,680
He is not simple.

117
00:06:23,590 --> 00:06:24,860
These women from the Floating Cloud Sect

118
00:06:24,870 --> 00:06:27,310
also have something indescribably wrong about them.

119
00:06:27,830 --> 00:06:28,620
Agreed.

120
00:06:30,190 --> 00:06:31,180
Then let's go.

121
00:06:35,670 --> 00:06:37,220
The abyss is filled with danger

122
00:06:37,790 --> 00:06:39,310
but I can use their strength

123
00:06:39,390 --> 00:06:40,950
to scout this place.

124
00:06:42,070 --> 00:06:43,540
If they have ill-intent,

125
00:06:44,590 --> 00:06:45,740
I'll just kill them.

126
00:06:58,310 --> 00:06:58,980
Everyone,

127
00:06:59,390 --> 00:07:00,910
there are treasures all around the place.

128
00:07:01,110 --> 00:07:02,350
We shall each rely on our own abilities

129
00:07:02,350 --> 00:07:03,550
to search for them.

130
00:07:03,590 --> 00:07:04,830
Call for help when in danger.

131
00:07:17,630 --> 00:07:19,220
As expected, it's a one-way restriction.

132
00:07:20,070 --> 00:07:21,220
If someone were to force it,

133
00:07:22,230 --> 00:07:24,750
I'm afraid they would be crushed by the laws of this place.

134
00:07:25,830 --> 00:07:29,110
It seems the only way to leave is indeed through the exit in the Fire Demon Country.

135
00:07:42,030 --> 00:07:43,430
Demonic beasts all around...

136
00:07:43,510 --> 00:07:44,540
Interconnected caves...

137
00:07:45,830 --> 00:07:48,390
Truly worthy of being a thousands of years old treasure abyss.

138
00:07:49,190 --> 00:07:51,390
Fortunately, I have the jade slip gifted by the Ancient Demon

139
00:07:51,430 --> 00:07:52,620
to help me find my way.

140
00:07:53,670 --> 00:07:54,820
To rescue Senior Zhou Yi,

141
00:07:55,110 --> 00:07:56,020
I need to take my time

142
00:07:56,510 --> 00:07:57,820
and plan accordingly.

143
00:08:00,710 --> 00:08:03,510
1 day later

144
00:08:02,230 --> 00:08:02,870
Everyone,

145
00:08:02,870 --> 00:08:03,500
follow me.

146
00:08:04,390 --> 00:08:06,990
Ancient Tree\NTide Abyss

147
00:08:09,550 --> 00:08:10,340
It's right there.

148
00:08:11,070 --> 00:08:12,180
The Tian Yun Sword !

149
00:08:13,590 --> 00:08:14,340
This sword

150
00:08:14,990 --> 00:08:17,180
is one of the 7 swords of Master All-Seer.

151
00:08:18,110 --> 00:08:20,380
They were given to the Seven Sons of Tian Yun as guardian artifacts.

152
00:08:21,470 --> 00:08:22,940
However, over the countless years,

153
00:08:23,510 --> 00:08:25,500
3 of them went missing with their owners.

154
00:08:27,470 --> 00:08:29,070
Junior Brother Sun Yun of the Purple Division

155
00:08:29,470 --> 00:08:31,670
disappeared back then while carrying this sword.

156
00:08:32,190 --> 00:08:32,980
Brother Murong,

157
00:08:33,630 --> 00:08:34,260
Junior Sister Zhao,

158
00:08:34,950 --> 00:08:35,580
Junior Sister Xu,

159
00:08:36,190 --> 00:08:38,380
this sword belongs to the Heavenly Fate Sect.

160
00:08:39,110 --> 00:08:39,700
Today,

161
00:08:39,990 --> 00:08:40,700
I, Du Jian,

162
00:08:40,990 --> 00:08:41,900
need to ask you a favor.

163
00:08:42,590 --> 00:08:43,340
How about

164
00:08:43,390 --> 00:08:45,190
we let Junior Brother Wang take this sword ?

165
00:08:45,390 --> 00:08:47,480
He's a disciple of the Purple Division of our Heavenly Fate Sect.

166
00:08:47,590 --> 00:08:48,870
Giving him the sword

167
00:08:48,990 --> 00:08:50,830
is like returning it to its original owner.

168
00:08:53,070 --> 00:08:53,660
Junior Brother Wang,

169
00:08:54,350 --> 00:08:54,980
this sword

170
00:08:55,430 --> 00:08:56,870
originally belonged to your Purple Division.

171
00:08:57,070 --> 00:08:58,060
Senior Brother won't steal it

172
00:08:58,710 --> 00:09:00,220
and I won't let anyone else steal it either !

173
00:09:01,630 --> 00:09:03,190
Senior Brother Du is very virtuous.

174
00:09:09,310 --> 00:09:10,550
This tree isn't normal.

175
00:09:10,590 --> 00:09:11,830
Fellow cultivator Wang, be careful.

176
00:09:11,990 --> 00:09:13,020
This Murong Zhuo

177
00:09:13,790 --> 00:09:15,420
does have some skill.

178
00:09:20,030 --> 00:09:20,980
Charge !

179
00:09:30,510 --> 00:09:32,260
Is the Tian Yun Sword Senior Brother spoke of

180
00:09:33,230 --> 00:09:34,780
this pile of scrap iron ?

181
00:09:35,870 --> 00:09:36,300
I...

182
00:09:36,670 --> 00:09:37,900
I was mistaken.

183
00:09:38,710 --> 00:09:41,960
How could Senior Brother Du, who has studied the Tide Abyss for decades

184
00:09:42,070 --> 00:09:43,780
be mistaken ?

185
00:09:54,190 --> 00:09:55,820
Do you see clearly now ?

186
00:09:56,390 --> 00:09:58,500
This tree is an illusion of poisonous insects.

187
00:10:01,630 --> 00:10:02,100
You...

188
00:10:02,510 --> 00:10:04,340
how did you see through it !?

189
00:10:05,710 --> 00:10:06,580
We've only just met

190
00:10:07,590 --> 00:10:09,750
but Senior Brother Du turns out to be an hypocrite.

191
00:10:10,670 --> 00:10:11,990
Given our relationship,

192
00:10:12,030 --> 00:10:13,950
how can we even be called brothers ?

193
00:10:14,390 --> 00:10:15,830
Since you tried to trap me,

194
00:10:16,310 --> 00:10:18,780
you should've expected the consequences as well.

195
00:10:21,790 --> 00:10:22,260
Everyone,

196
00:10:23,590 --> 00:10:24,300
let's continue.

197
00:10:25,030 --> 00:10:27,670
Cliff\NTide Abyss

198
00:10:39,790 --> 00:10:41,790
This is the 37th type of beast we encountered.

199
00:10:42,430 --> 00:10:43,630
This poison is already 3 times

200
00:10:43,670 --> 00:10:45,470
more concentrated than at the entrance.

201
00:11:16,150 --> 00:11:17,780
So that's how it is...

202
00:11:24,190 --> 00:11:25,790
I have private matters to attend to

203
00:11:26,030 --> 00:11:27,510
so I won't be going down with you.

204
00:11:28,230 --> 00:11:28,780
Brother Murong,

205
00:11:29,710 --> 00:11:31,300
if you ever need me in the future,

206
00:11:31,870 --> 00:11:32,740
don't hesitate.

207
00:11:33,830 --> 00:11:35,300
Brother Wang, if you need anything in the future,

208
00:11:35,990 --> 00:11:36,780
please do the same.

209
00:11:40,430 --> 00:11:42,230
Be careful of the two women beside you.

210
00:11:42,750 --> 00:11:43,900
If I'm not mistaken,

211
00:11:44,630 --> 00:11:46,300
they should be from the Corpse Sect.

212
00:11:47,630 --> 00:11:49,260
One is the Corpse Puppet

213
00:11:50,390 --> 00:11:51,790
and the other is the true body.

214
00:12:00,150 --> 00:12:03,270
Cliff\NTide Abyss

215
00:12:05,870 --> 00:12:07,310
The place Bei Luo pointed me to

216
00:12:07,630 --> 00:12:08,870
is right here.

217
00:12:10,230 --> 00:12:12,660
But why isn't there any trace of Senior Zhou Yi

218
00:12:12,670 --> 00:12:14,460
or of Ling Tianhou here ?

219
00:12:23,630 --> 00:12:26,220
I'm pretty sure Bei Luo didn't lie to me.

220
00:12:27,350 --> 00:12:28,420
If he wanted to harm me,

221
00:12:28,990 --> 00:12:30,180
he could have just done so.

222
00:12:31,590 --> 00:12:32,940
Even if he wanted to kill me,

223
00:12:33,630 --> 00:12:36,270
he should have tricked me into going to the bottom of the abyss instead.

224
00:12:36,790 --> 00:12:38,380
Where exactly did I go wrong ?

225
00:12:39,790 --> 00:12:41,500
If I were Ling Tianhou...

226
00:12:42,310 --> 00:12:44,100
What would I have done ?

227
00:12:45,790 --> 00:12:48,180
If I wanted to seal a Sword Spirit that was haunting me,

228
00:12:49,030 --> 00:12:50,620
I wouldn’t simply seal it.

229
00:12:50,910 --> 00:12:53,040
I'd restrict it for thousands of years

230
00:12:53,360 --> 00:12:55,010
to make it yield

231
00:12:55,030 --> 00:12:56,580
and submit to my tyranny.

232
00:12:57,040 --> 00:12:58,590
Such a seal would've been

233
00:12:59,470 --> 00:13:01,300
impossible on the surface.

234
00:13:18,670 --> 00:13:19,540
I found it.

235
00:13:32,670 --> 00:13:35,100
Ling Tianhou is a powerful rival of the All-Seer

236
00:13:36,590 --> 00:13:38,660
so he must be at least Late stage Nirvana Cleanser.

237
00:13:58,710 --> 00:13:59,900
Billion-Soul Flag !

238
00:14:14,070 --> 00:14:14,660
Master,

239
00:14:15,030 --> 00:14:16,540
that thing is too strong !

240
00:14:19,190 --> 00:14:19,700
I won't...

241
00:14:20,150 --> 00:14:22,180
be able to hold on !

242
00:14:23,590 --> 00:14:24,020
Go !

243
00:14:31,710 --> 00:14:34,380
Even the Scattered Devil soul couldn't last for a single breath !

244
00:14:36,710 --> 00:14:37,780
God-Slaying Chariot,

245
00:14:38,270 --> 00:14:38,750
activate !

246
00:14:48,190 --> 00:14:48,900
This aura...

247
00:14:49,950 --> 00:14:50,750
could it be ...?

248
00:14:53,270 --> 00:14:54,180
This is...

249
00:14:55,230 --> 00:14:56,940
Ling Tianhou's aura.

250
00:15:00,710 --> 00:15:02,860
The Sword Spirit's seal is well hidden.

251
00:15:03,310 --> 00:15:05,270
How could it have been discovered ?

252
00:15:06,990 --> 00:15:07,620
It's alright.

253
00:15:08,670 --> 00:15:10,410
It's just an ant trying to shake a tree.

254
00:15:10,550 --> 00:15:12,100
It's courting its own death.

255
00:15:33,390 --> 00:15:34,940
A single strike from a strand of his Divine Sense

256
00:15:35,750 --> 00:15:37,100
is actually this powerful...

257
00:15:38,670 --> 00:15:40,020
With my own strength,

258
00:15:41,150 --> 00:15:43,750
it's absolutely impossible to beat with this Divine Sense.

259
00:15:44,670 --> 00:15:45,710
Master, please think twice !

260
00:15:45,910 --> 00:15:47,630
That old ghost is not to be messed with !

261
00:16:04,350 --> 00:16:05,700
I have fought all my life

262
00:16:06,430 --> 00:16:08,060
and seen too much deception.

263
00:16:09,590 --> 00:16:11,870
But one of the only sincere people I met

264
00:16:12,590 --> 00:16:14,340
has instead left me with an obsession

265
00:16:15,110 --> 00:16:16,540
within my Dao.

266
00:16:19,910 --> 00:16:20,620
Back then,

267
00:16:21,790 --> 00:16:23,940
his infatuation made him breakthough to Ascendant.

268
00:16:25,430 --> 00:16:26,220
And I

269
00:16:26,590 --> 00:16:28,580
was just a Soul Formation Junior.

270
00:16:30,550 --> 00:16:31,180
But now,

271
00:16:32,230 --> 00:16:33,980
I have also reached Ascendant.

